    // at t (0 base, 1 tip). A sheet (drawn on both sides) of NS x NW cells; its outline is the cells' edge: rounded at the base, widest
    // a third of the way along, a pointed tip, small teeth along both edges; a raised midrib, the edges curled a little back.
